  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Automated Tape Laminator</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-ATL-a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>3 Composite heads and 2 film heads</li>\n<li>Up to 12 inch (305 mm) wide uni-tape, 0/90 fabric, ±45 ° fabric</li>\n<li>36 ft (10.9 m) long parts</li>\n<li>15 minutes per part</li>\n<li>Start and stop accuracy of ±0.030” (.76 mm)</li>\n<li>Ply straightness is ±0.030” (.76 mm)</li>\n<li>Up to 50 lbs/hr (22.7 kg/hr)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Automated Tape Laying</h3><ul><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/automated-tape-laminator/\">Automated Tape Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/ply-by-ply-tape-laminator/\">Ply-by-Ply Tape Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/tp-staker-laminator/\">Thermoplastic Staker / Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/electron-beam-tape-laminator/\">Electron Beam Tape Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/insitu-thermoplastic-laminator-i/\">Insitu Thermoplastic Laminator I</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/insitu-thermoplastic-laminator-ii/\">Insitu Thermoplastic Laminator II</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/lab-scale-atl-machine/\">Lab-Scale ATL Machine</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-ATL-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-ATL-b-295x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"295\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-ATL-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-ATL-a-300x236.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"236\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
